                              "id": "417a0f60-8e1e-42a4-a3ce-49e2f391aa9e",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The useful\ndiscovery is\nnarrow and solid:\nyou have a right\nto reach",
                                  "the pipes, not a\nright to take over\nthe lodge. Nib\nedits his pitch",
                                  "to say exactly\nthat. The revised\nversion is less\nthrilling, but the",
                                  "clerk agrees to\nfile it."
                                ],
